  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9703.01 Eligible Applicants. Eligible applicants shall include local municipal law enforcement agencies or county sheriff’s department that employ sworn law enforcement officers with arrest powers.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
